WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org


01:15.765 --> 01:17.249
Oh, God.

01:46.313 --> 01:47.348
Oh, shit.

02:06.056 --> 02:09.198
♪ If I could put my problems
in the papers ♪

02:09.336 --> 02:12.339
♪ Then I'd roll them up
and blow them away ♪

02:14.272 --> 02:16.239
♪ If I could find a pill
to solve them ♪

02:16.377 --> 02:19.484
♪ I would take a bottle
and I'd be okay ♪

02:21.106 --> 02:23.039
♪ If life was that easy ♪

02:23.177 --> 02:26.387
♪ Then I'd never have to worry
for the rest of my days ♪

02:26.525 --> 02:27.664
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

02:27.802 --> 02:29.114
Thank you, sir.

02:29.252 --> 02:33.222
♪ But life
just ain't that easy ♪

02:33.360 --> 02:36.846
- ♪ Oh, no ♪
- ♪ No, no ♪

02:36.984 --> 02:40.090
♪ It's taking its toll
on me deep down ♪

02:40.229 --> 02:42.645
- ♪ In my soul. ♪
-Brockman.

02:44.957 --> 02:46.235
Brockman!

02:48.961 --> 02:50.342
Today is your lucky day.

02:50.480 --> 02:52.275
I got a FRAGO for you
and Corporal Selby here.

02:52.413 --> 02:53.966
I've got no one else to cover

02:54.104 --> 02:57.211
down for Godina today
on a malfunctioning GPR unit.

02:57.349 --> 02:59.420
Swing by the armory. Gear up.

03:02.009 --> 03:04.045
Great. Um...

03:04.184 --> 03:06.255
Brockman.

03:06.393 --> 03:07.946
Look...

03:08.084 --> 03:10.949
Piece of advice,
you may outrank me,

03:11.087 --> 03:13.917
but the least you can do is
button your blouse correctly.

03:19.785 --> 03:20.959
Oh, shit.

03:24.204 --> 03:26.482
Man, this... Hey, yo,

03:26.620 --> 03:28.415
this BDC reticle is fire,

03:28.553 --> 03:29.933
and this stock is heavier
than the standard issue,

03:30.071 --> 03:31.349
so I have more control.

03:31.487 --> 03:33.109
Lee...

03:34.455 --> 03:37.044
I got a feeling
I ain't in Kansas anymore.

03:37.182 --> 03:38.666
Okay. Calm down, Dorothy.

03:38.804 --> 03:40.392
Dude, I got your back,
baby. Don't worry.

03:40.530 --> 03:42.118
Yeah,
that's what I'm afraid of.

03:43.844 --> 03:45.397
Wait. What happened
to Sergeant Godina?

03:45.535 --> 03:47.434
He's sick.

03:47.572 --> 03:51.403
What, Godina gets the shits
and we get you?

03:51.541 --> 03:52.853
Dude's a lucky man.

03:55.096 --> 03:56.270
Yeah, I'd rather have the shits

03:56.408 --> 03:57.858
than be on a helicopter
right now.

03:57.996 --> 03:59.618
Okay. Let's focus
on the mission, guys.

03:59.756 --> 04:00.757
Okay.

04:00.895 --> 04:02.932
Can we even call this a mission?

04:03.070 --> 04:05.659
Do you take anything seriously?

04:05.797 --> 04:09.801
No. But here's
what's gonna happen.

04:09.939 --> 04:13.770
Okay, so G.I. Joker over here
and his sidekick...

04:13.908 --> 04:15.082
I'm not a fucking sidekick.

04:15.220 --> 04:16.773
Yeah, you are.

04:16.911 --> 04:19.155
Anyways, you're gonna
run around acting all tough

04:19.293 --> 04:20.984
because they think
that the Deltas

04:21.122 --> 04:24.333
are gonna be watching them,
when in reality, they're not.

04:27.197 --> 04:29.096
And you are gonna be
on the ground

04:29.234 --> 04:31.374
for, like, 20 minutes.

04:31.512 --> 04:34.135
Just do yourself a favor
and leave this shit behind.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.517
That's not gonna happen.

04:36.655 --> 04:38.036
I had a feeling you'd say that.

04:38.174 --> 04:40.797
Okay, what about you, smart-ass?

04:40.935 --> 04:43.628
Me? Ooh,
I am going to be daydreaming

04:43.766 --> 04:46.147
of a seven-figure salary
in Silicon Valley

04:46.286 --> 04:48.357
while I'm babysitting
this defense contractor

04:48.495 --> 04:50.359
who's just gonna push
a couple of buttons

04:50.497 --> 04:51.981
and pretend
like he's a fucking hero.

04:52.119 --> 04:53.500
It's a bit
more complicated than that.

04:58.332 --> 05:00.645
What? Repairing a radar unit

05:00.783 --> 05:02.647
that tracks underground
activity is no joke.

05:02.785 --> 05:04.994
And, more importantly...

05:06.133 --> 05:09.412
...this dude right here wouldn't
last a week in Silicon Valley.

05:09.550 --> 05:12.553
Ha-ha. Okay.

05:12.691 --> 05:14.072
Joshua Weaver,

05:14.210 --> 05:17.386
Quantico Systems,
Senior Signals Analyst

05:17.524 --> 05:19.008
reporting for duty.

05:19.146 --> 05:20.354
- Oh, wow.
- Shit.

05:20.492 --> 05:22.356
So I'm gonna...

05:22.494 --> 05:24.082
No, don't look at me.
That's your people.

05:24.220 --> 05:26.360
- Him? No. Not my people.
-[chuckles] Yeah.

05:28.017 --> 05:29.674
All right. Whatever.
I don't care.

05:29.812 --> 05:31.883
I'm just here to get this unit
back up and running,

05:32.021 --> 05:34.161
help the world sleep
a little better.

05:35.404 --> 05:37.958
I think the world was sleeping
just fine without you.

05:38.096 --> 05:39.339
Mmm.

05:40.823 --> 05:42.928
You guys should get a room.

05:43.066 --> 05:46.380
Maybe we should, you know,
save some money.

05:50.936 --> 05:51.903
♪ Are you ready? ♪

05:52.041 --> 05:53.836
♪ Okay, say no more ♪

05:53.974 --> 05:54.940
♪ Are you ready? ♪

05:55.078 --> 05:56.563
♪ Okay, say no more ♪

05:56.701 --> 05:57.667
♪ She's a lotus
and I'm the conductor ♪

05:57.805 --> 05:58.979
♪ Of a magnum opus ♪

05:59.117 --> 06:00.705
♪ Simply braggadocios ♪

06:00.843 --> 06:02.292
♪ Why don't we take advantage
of this moment ♪

06:02.431 --> 06:04.398
♪ And whatever you own
we owned it ♪

06:04.536 --> 06:05.986
All right, let's do it.

06:09.645 --> 06:12.682
♪ 'Cause nobody really cares ♪

06:13.821 --> 06:16.548
♪ 'Cause nobody really cares ♪

06:18.205 --> 06:19.793
- ♪ 'Cause nobody really cares ♪
- ♪ Mama, I'm on the big screen ♪

06:19.931 --> 06:21.829
♪ I took a big swing
out of life ♪

06:21.967 --> 06:24.314
♪ I'm doing big things
in my life ♪

06:24.453 --> 06:25.868
♪ I deserve six rings
like I'm Mike... ♪

06:28.526 --> 06:31.149
Brockman, Weaver, you're up!

06:31.287 --> 06:33.703
- All right, you ready?
- You ready?

06:35.256 --> 06:37.742
Never better. Let's go.

06:37.880 --> 06:39.157
Let's go. Let's go.

06:39.295 --> 06:40.365
♪ Are you ready? ♪

06:40.503 --> 06:41.711
♪ Okay, say no more ♪

07:15.745 --> 07:17.782
Didn't you see
I just fell down back there?

07:17.920 --> 07:19.473
Yeah.

07:19.611 --> 07:21.648
What the fuck?

07:21.786 --> 07:23.650
Let's just get this
GPR unit back on line

07:23.788 --> 07:25.583
and just head back home.

07:27.895 --> 07:30.242
I mean, you're welcome
to help if you want.

07:30.380 --> 07:32.037
Here. Take it.

07:32.175 --> 07:33.625
No? That's right.

07:53.300 --> 07:55.198
Yeah, it definitely seems
like a hardware issue.

07:55.336 --> 07:57.994
Yeah, no, definitely
a hardware issue.

07:58.132 --> 08:01.273
Like those frayed cables
in your hand. Great.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.966
Hardware.

08:05.001 --> 08:06.209
Okay. Strip them down,

08:06.347 --> 08:07.590
and then I'll update
the software.

08:07.728 --> 08:09.489
Come on, man.
It's pretty basic shit.

08:10.973 --> 08:12.043
PILOT [over radio]:
Master Sergeant,

08:12.181 --> 08:13.803
extreme weather is
coming in fast.

08:13.941 --> 08:16.185
Condor is pulling the plug.
Let's go.

08:16.323 --> 08:18.221
Copy that.

08:18.359 --> 08:20.085
Brockman,
weather's coming in fast.

08:20.223 --> 08:21.915
We gotta get out of here.

08:22.053 --> 08:23.088
Roger that.

08:23.226 --> 08:24.469
We're coming back now.

08:24.607 --> 08:26.782
- All right. Pulling the plug.
- What?

08:26.920 --> 08:29.198
- Why?
- Because we got orders.

08:29.336 --> 08:31.856
Just connect those wires
and you're back in business.

08:31.994 --> 08:34.410
Officially just became
somebody else's job, so...

08:34.548 --> 08:36.343
Let's go.

08:38.656 --> 08:40.692
So this is being all you can be.

08:41.935 --> 08:43.074
Yep.

08:43.212 --> 08:44.524
Great.

08:48.907 --> 08:50.253
Go, go, go!

08:52.877 --> 08:54.844
Let's go, let's go.

08:59.193 --> 09:01.195
Let's hustle, Weaver.
Let's go.

09:04.923 --> 09:06.304
All right. We're good.
We're good.

09:08.686 --> 09:11.067
Wheels up, wheels up.

09:23.597 --> 09:25.392
MAN [over radio]:
Turn right, heading 270.

09:25.530 --> 09:28.775
Caution. High-risk wind shear
activity in your area.

09:28.913 --> 09:31.501
Copy, Alpha One. Heading 270.

09:33.642 --> 09:36.058
We're experiencing
severe turbulence.

09:36.196 --> 09:38.025
Requesting vectors
for alternate flight paths.

09:38.163 --> 09:41.028
- This is normal, right?
- Yep. We're okay.

09:55.249 --> 09:56.734
Mayday! Mayday!

09:56.872 --> 09:58.701
Mayday! Engine failure.

10:00.289 --> 10:02.705
Mayday! Mayday!
We've lost both engines!

10:02.843 --> 10:04.120
No, no, no. Fuck.

10:22.449 --> 10:25.694
Oh, shit. Selby, Selby,
Selby, wake up.

10:25.832 --> 10:27.005
Selby?

10:27.143 --> 10:28.938
- Selby.
- Hmm? What?

10:29.076 --> 10:31.492
Stop. Stop.

10:32.701 --> 10:33.805
Shit.

10:39.155 --> 10:41.054
Look at me...

10:41.192 --> 10:42.711
We gotta get out of here.

10:52.652 --> 10:54.895
- Follow my lead.
- Yeah, yeah.

11:06.355 --> 11:07.701
Selby...

11:07.839 --> 11:09.945
I can't. No, I can't.

11:32.001 --> 11:34.417
X-ray. X-ray, you on comms?

11:35.522 --> 11:37.282
Fuck.

11:50.779 --> 11:52.228
Lee.

11:52.366 --> 11:54.783
Shh. Shh.

11:54.921 --> 11:56.163
Weaver.

11:56.301 --> 11:57.820
Hey. Weaver.

11:57.958 --> 11:59.719
What the fuck just happened?

11:59.857 --> 12:02.135
- Are you good? You good?
- Yeah.

12:02.273 --> 12:04.102
Okay. Have you seen Ross?

12:04.240 --> 12:05.828
Who the fuck is Ross?

12:05.966 --> 12:07.899
Help!

12:09.556 --> 12:10.868
Ross.

12:11.006 --> 12:12.973
Ross. Ross!

12:17.046 --> 12:18.289
Fuck!

12:20.394 --> 12:22.431
Ross. Ross. Hey, hey.

12:26.607 --> 12:28.230
I got you. I got you.

12:31.820 --> 12:33.614
I've got you.

12:33.753 --> 12:36.617
Oh, shit. Shit. My ribs.

12:38.758 --> 12:40.380
Weaver.

12:44.177 --> 12:45.765
Look at me. Look at me.

12:45.903 --> 12:47.421
- You okay?
-  Yeah.

12:47.559 --> 12:48.940
- Yeah.
- Look at me.

12:49.078 --> 12:50.700
- You're good.
- I'm fine. I'm fine.

12:50.839 --> 12:52.772
I need some help over here!

12:52.910 --> 12:54.843
- Stay right here.
- Okay.

12:57.155 --> 12:58.639
What do we got, Selby?

12:58.778 --> 12:59.986
Help me move him
away from the helicopter.

13:00.124 --> 13:01.642
-Ready?
- Three, two, one. Go!

13:01.781 --> 13:04.438
Go, go, go, go. There we go.

13:08.995 --> 13:11.342
Chief?

13:11.480 --> 13:13.033
Chief.

13:13.171 --> 13:14.828
Hold still. Hold still, Chief.

13:22.146 --> 13:24.838
Okay.

13:24.976 --> 13:26.771
Here we go. Ready, Chief?

13:26.909 --> 13:28.980
Three, two, one.

13:33.709 --> 13:35.055
Okay.

13:35.193 --> 13:37.126
-Hey!
-Go, go, go, go!

13:37.264 --> 13:38.990
Master Sergeant!

13:48.379 --> 13:49.725
Come on. I got you.

13:49.863 --> 13:52.624
- Okay. Okay. Here we go.
- No, no, no, no.

13:52.762 --> 13:54.419
It's going through my hip.

13:56.352 --> 13:59.286
Okay.

14:01.737 --> 14:03.394
Chief?

14:03.532 --> 14:06.880
Selby has him.
He's pretty banged up, sir.

14:07.018 --> 14:08.986
Fuck. Go and get

14:09.124 --> 14:10.850
the crash can
and bring me a satellite phone.

14:12.023 --> 14:13.473
- Yes, sir.
- Quick.

14:28.384 --> 14:30.214
Jesus.

15:11.255 --> 15:12.635
It's okay, it's okay.

15:12.773 --> 15:13.982
Here you go, sir.

15:19.056 --> 15:20.989
Condor, talk.

15:21.127 --> 15:23.646
This is Valiant One
on an unsecured line.

15:23.784 --> 15:26.753
We are down. We are down.

15:26.891 --> 15:28.479
Request immediate medevac.

15:28.617 --> 15:30.308
MAN [over phone]: Valiant One,
medevac is unavailable

15:30.446 --> 15:32.345
for your current coordinates.

15:32.483 --> 15:34.830
You are outside
U.S. and ROK airspace.

15:34.968 --> 15:38.144
I repeat, you are outside
U.S. and ROK airspace.

15:38.282 --> 15:42.527
New exfil location
is grid square 3763.

15:42.665 --> 15:45.634
Delta Forces will be waiting.

15:45.772 --> 15:47.601
Copy.

15:47.739 --> 15:49.465
Valiant One out.

15:49.603 --> 15:51.295
They're not coming.

15:51.433 --> 15:52.917
No.

15:53.055 --> 15:54.367
- This is Sergeant Brockman.
- They're not coming.

15:54.505 --> 15:55.816
This is Sergeant Brockman.

15:55.955 --> 15:57.301
Valiant One.
We have multiple injured.

15:57.439 --> 15:58.854
We need medevac immediately.

15:58.992 --> 16:01.339
MAN [over phone]: Repeat,
medevac is unavailable.

16:01.477 --> 16:03.652
Proceed to grid square 3763.

16:03.790 --> 16:05.378
- Delta Forces will be waiting.
- No.

16:05.516 --> 16:06.862
No, no, no, no, no.

16:07.000 --> 16:09.209
Fuck that, Condor.
We have multiple dead!

16:09.347 --> 16:11.556
Multiple wounded!
We need a medevac right now!

16:11.694 --> 16:12.695
- Stop, stop, stop.
- Right now!

16:12.833 --> 16:14.145
They can't get us.

16:14.283 --> 16:15.802
We're in North Korea.

16:18.460 --> 16:21.014
Hang that up. Hang that up.

16:21.152 --> 16:22.740
Look at me.

16:22.878 --> 16:25.225
Even if a rescue team
could make it past their SAMs,

16:25.363 --> 16:27.365
coming to get us
would be an act of war.

16:28.711 --> 16:30.886
If we didn't
already start one, okay?

16:33.026 --> 16:34.683
So you're gonna have to
get these people out of here.

16:34.821 --> 16:36.064
No, you're gonna
get us out of here.

16:36.202 --> 16:37.720
You're gonna get us-- Selby!

16:37.858 --> 16:40.551
Selby. Selby,
I need your help.

16:40.689 --> 16:41.690
I need your help!

16:41.828 --> 16:43.726
Brockman, just calm down, okay?

16:43.864 --> 16:46.522
Calm down.

16:46.660 --> 16:47.868
Chief?

16:48.007 --> 16:49.663
-He's banged up.
- How bad?

16:50.802 --> 16:52.908
Compound fractures in both legs
and probably head trauma.

16:53.046 --> 16:54.220
But he's stable.

16:54.358 --> 16:56.567
Ah, fuck. Okay.

16:56.705 --> 16:59.225
Sir, I'll be right back, okay?

16:59.363 --> 17:01.227
Just... Just one second.

17:07.233 --> 17:08.889
Hey, even if I could
get in there,

17:09.028 --> 17:10.926
his pulse is too weak and
he's hemorrhaging internally.

17:11.064 --> 17:12.859
I'll keep him stable
till medevac gets here.

17:15.793 --> 17:18.002
There's... there's not
gonna be a medevac.

17:19.521 --> 17:20.763
- What?
- What?

17:20.901 --> 17:24.146
Wait. Wait, what? Uh...

17:24.284 --> 17:25.803
What-what the fuck
does that mean?

17:25.941 --> 17:27.805
It means we're in North Korea.

17:29.565 --> 17:31.222
That's what it means.

17:33.776 --> 17:38.919
They can't just, like,
leave us here, right?

17:45.271 --> 17:46.927
Give me that.

17:47.066 --> 17:49.413
Give me that.

17:49.551 --> 17:51.242
I'll call my team in Seoul.

17:51.380 --> 17:52.588
- They'll definitely...
- You listen to me.

17:52.726 --> 17:53.969
Orders were
to stay radio silent.

17:54.107 --> 17:56.075
We're heading
to grid square 3763.

17:56.213 --> 17:57.835
How far?

17:57.973 --> 17:59.595
I... I have no idea.

17:59.733 --> 18:01.183
And fucking what?
They'll come get us there?

18:01.321 --> 18:02.771
I don't know.

18:02.909 --> 18:04.911
What the fuck do you know?

18:08.708 --> 18:10.192
Fuck.

18:12.401 --> 18:14.403
Brockman.

18:14.541 --> 18:15.818
Brockman.

18:15.956 --> 18:17.337
Listen to me.

18:17.475 --> 18:19.822
The North Koreans will
already be on their way.

18:20.823 --> 18:23.412
And I need you
to do something for me.

18:28.486 --> 18:31.213
My grandfather gave this
to my father.

18:31.351 --> 18:34.078
He passed it on to me.

18:34.216 --> 18:37.426
And I need you to get this
to my little boy.

18:37.564 --> 18:38.772
Okay?

18:47.781 --> 18:49.128
Don't let it end here.

18:51.095 --> 18:53.201
And, uh,

18:53.339 --> 18:56.549
I want you to tell him that
his daddy loves him very much.

18:56.687 --> 18:58.896
More than anything in the world.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.485
You can do this.

19:01.623 --> 19:03.935
You just gotta trust
your instincts.

19:04.073 --> 19:06.317
- I'm not trained for this.
- Yes, you are.

19:06.455 --> 19:09.631
That rank on your chest
makes you the leader.

19:09.769 --> 19:11.529
Okay?

19:11.667 --> 19:13.911
Right now, you're the leader.

19:14.049 --> 19:16.983
So you gotta be that for them.

19:17.121 --> 19:19.399
And for yourself.

19:19.537 --> 19:20.883
Sir, respectfully, I-I'm...

19:21.021 --> 19:22.402
In charge now.

19:22.540 --> 19:24.163
You're in charge.

19:24.301 --> 19:26.165
I know there's a lot going on
in your brain right now.

19:26.303 --> 19:27.821
Your emotions are high,
and all that shit.

19:27.959 --> 19:29.513
You gotta put that away, okay?

19:29.651 --> 19:30.859
You deal with that
when you get home,

19:30.997 --> 19:32.688
because right now,
you stay in the trees

19:32.826 --> 19:34.690
as much as you can.
You use it as cover.

19:34.828 --> 19:36.002
You get out there,
you keep moving,

19:36.140 --> 19:38.038
no matter what happens,

19:38.177 --> 19:40.075
and you get your people
to that exfil.

19:40.213 --> 19:42.560
Because my boys will be there.

19:42.698 --> 19:44.079
They...

19:45.598 --> 19:47.220
I promise you that.

19:48.773 --> 19:51.190
I'm gonna buy you some time.

19:55.159 --> 19:56.540
Hand me a frag.

19:56.678 --> 19:58.335
No. We gotta get you
out of here.

19:58.473 --> 20:00.923
Stop. Don't move me.
Please don't move me.

20:01.061 --> 20:04.755
Look, it's okay.

20:05.894 --> 20:07.447
Come on.

20:07.585 --> 20:10.485
I can't use my left hand.
I need you to unwrap it.

20:22.393 --> 20:24.292
You got this.

20:28.192 --> 20:30.643
You just get to exfil,

20:30.781 --> 20:34.440
and Delta will be there,
I promise you that.

20:36.890 --> 20:38.582
Get yourself home, kid.

20:40.756 --> 20:41.895
Yes, sir.

20:58.015 --> 20:59.050
Come on.

21:00.914 --> 21:01.950
What about Lebold?

21:02.088 --> 21:03.745
- He's not coming.
- What...

21:04.918 --> 21:06.437
- Shit.
-Maybe we, uh...

21:06.575 --> 21:08.508
Maybe we just give up...

21:10.096 --> 21:12.305
...and let the U.S.
negotiate us out.

21:12.443 --> 21:14.100
Okay. Fuck this guy.

21:14.238 --> 21:16.620
Come on.

21:18.415 --> 21:19.795
Let's go.

21:45.683 --> 21:47.513
Hey, hey, hold up, hold up.

22:00.836 --> 22:03.632
Brockman. Are we going
the right way?

22:12.054 --> 22:13.504
Brockman.

22:16.542 --> 22:17.991
Are we going the right way?

22:18.129 --> 22:20.062
I was trained to analyze data
and update hardware.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.616
Not this. All right?

22:21.754 --> 22:23.411
So if you guys could just
give me a goddamn minute

22:23.549 --> 22:24.895
to figure out where the fuck
we are, that would be great.

22:25.033 --> 22:26.862
Hey, we're gonna be dead
in a goddamn minute.

22:27.000 --> 22:29.417
Yeah. Those fucking
helicopters are everywhere.

22:33.490 --> 22:35.008
We were told
to follow these coordinates

22:35.146 --> 22:36.596
to the exfil, all right?

22:36.734 --> 22:38.357
If we get there,
Delta will bring us home.

22:38.495 --> 22:40.082
If we get there?

22:43.741 --> 22:46.917
This guy is cooked.
Who's up next?

22:48.056 --> 22:49.816
That's not how this works.

22:55.581 --> 22:56.892
Get Chief up.

22:57.030 --> 22:58.238
Let's go.

23:02.139 --> 23:03.416
Let's go!

23:10.078 --> 23:11.631
Okay. Okay. Hold on. Hold on.

23:11.769 --> 23:12.977
Wait. Wait.
Let me get this straight.

23:13.115 --> 23:14.979
Okay. Guys, guys.
Wait. Wait. Hold...

23:15.117 --> 23:17.913
- We are going deeper into...
- Shut your mouth.

23:18.051 --> 23:20.399
We are going deeper
into North Korea,

23:20.537 --> 23:21.986
following a guy

23:22.124 --> 23:23.919
who has very little education,
very little experience

23:24.057 --> 23:26.128
and no idea
what the fuck he's doing.

23:28.648 --> 23:30.305
This is fucking stupid.

23:30.443 --> 23:32.065
Right? I mean...

23:32.203 --> 23:33.791
Please, man, just get back
on that fucking sat phone,

23:33.929 --> 23:35.137
- and tell them to pick us up!
- That sat phone is traceable.

23:35.275 --> 23:36.587
You know that!

23:36.725 --> 23:38.002
Those North Koreans
are praying to God

23:38.140 --> 23:39.348
we fucking are stupid enough
to use it.

23:39.487 --> 23:41.661
Seriously. Come on, man.

23:41.799 --> 23:43.974
I'm right.
You know I'm right. Right?

23:44.112 --> 23:45.976
It's what he says.

23:47.943 --> 23:49.393
Let's fucking go.

23:53.604 --> 23:55.468
-<i>Our Father...</i>
- Fuck.

23:57.505 --> 23:59.507
<i>...who art in heaven...</i>

24:06.306 --> 24:08.239
...hallowed be thy name.

24:11.346 --> 24:13.210
<i>Thy kingdom come.</i>

24:14.763 --> 24:16.593
<i>Thy will be done...</i>

24:18.836 --> 24:23.358
<i>...on earth as it is in heaven.</i>

24:29.157 --> 24:30.952
Oh, fuck.

24:51.179 --> 24:54.458
<i>Give us this day
our daily bread...</i>

24:56.322 --> 24:59.428
<i>...and forgive us
our trespasses...</i>

25:26.041 --> 25:31.219
<i>...as we forgive those...</i>

25:31.357 --> 25:33.773
<i>who trespass against us.</i>

25:33.911 --> 25:36.086
BROCKMAN [whispering]:
Weaver, get back.

25:36.224 --> 25:38.847
The fuck, man?

25:46.579 --> 25:49.030
- What the fuck?
- I don't know.

25:49.168 --> 25:51.239
What the fuck?

25:55.657 --> 25:56.727
Hey.

26:01.249 --> 26:02.802
WEAVER [whispering]:
Over here. Over here.

26:11.121 --> 26:15.263
Lead us not into temptation...

26:20.958 --> 26:23.271
...but deliver us from evil.

26:34.834 --> 26:36.664
BROCKMAN [softly]:
Stay down.

26:46.466 --> 26:47.813
We're clear.

26:50.988 --> 26:53.163
I'm gonna kill him.

26:53.301 --> 26:54.854
You selfish bitch.

26:54.992 --> 26:57.546
You stupid bastard...

26:57.685 --> 26:59.963
I just, I told you I thought
that we should give ourselves up

27:00.101 --> 27:02.793
and let the U.S. negotiate
our release. -Fuck that shit.

27:02.931 --> 27:04.519
Listen to me.
Listen to me, man, okay?

27:04.657 --> 27:08.005
Giving up... Giving up
makes way more fucking sense

27:08.143 --> 27:09.662
than dying out there, man.

27:09.800 --> 27:11.871
No, no, no. Not for me, man.
I'm Korean American.

27:12.009 --> 27:13.493
I get caught here,

27:13.632 --> 27:14.874
they'll literally fuck me
up the ass with a pole

27:15.012 --> 27:16.704
and then wave me around
like a fucking flag.

27:16.842 --> 27:18.982
No. No, dude.

27:19.120 --> 27:21.053
We're protected
by the Geneva Convention.

27:21.191 --> 27:23.883
No, we're not. North Korea
doesn't give a shit

27:24.021 --> 27:25.402
about the Geneva Convention.

27:25.540 --> 27:27.991
Capturing us
is exactly what they want.

27:28.129 --> 27:29.544
And when they get ahold of you,

27:29.682 --> 27:30.890
they're gonna squeeze
your fucking brain

27:31.028 --> 27:32.029
for every last bit of intel

27:32.167 --> 27:34.860
and send you back a vegetable.

27:34.998 --> 27:37.897
So go ahead.
Be my fucking guest.

27:39.519 --> 27:41.176
We're moving out. Let's go.

27:42.281 --> 27:44.386
Good luck in that
torture chamber, asshole.

28:07.582 --> 28:09.066
Oh, shit.

28:10.481 --> 28:11.897
Oh, shit.

28:25.704 --> 28:27.878
How are we supposed
to get Chief down there?

28:28.016 --> 28:29.569
Okay.

28:34.229 --> 28:36.300
No. Oh, God.

28:41.478 --> 28:43.238
We gotta go.
We gotta get better cover.

28:43.376 --> 28:45.620
Come on. Let's go. Come on.
We gotta get better cover.

28:55.561 --> 28:57.666
Get back here.

28:57.805 --> 28:59.876
- Lee. Get back.
- They can fucking see us.

29:02.326 --> 29:03.293
Fuck.

29:03.431 --> 29:04.708
Shh.

29:06.814 --> 29:07.987
Hurry! Get him back!

29:08.125 --> 29:10.300
Be careful with him.

29:16.616 --> 29:18.066
Shh. Shh, shh.

29:22.830 --> 29:24.521
You little fucker.

29:31.148 --> 29:33.323
Don't fucking move.

29:33.461 --> 29:35.118
I'm not fucking moving.

29:37.879 --> 29:39.639
Don't do it. Don't do it.

29:51.306 --> 29:53.964
Fuck.

29:58.762 --> 30:01.489
- Okay?
- Shit. Fuck.

30:02.939 --> 30:04.319
Are you good?

30:04.457 --> 30:05.838
-Oh, fuck.
- Yeah.

30:05.976 --> 30:07.598
We're fucking great.

30:09.324 --> 30:10.739
Ready?

30:10.878 --> 30:12.500
Let's go.

30:34.453 --> 30:36.904
This is
fucking insane, you know.

30:37.042 --> 30:39.423
I'm so used to just being
behind keyboards.

30:39.561 --> 30:41.184
Listen.

30:42.392 --> 30:44.739
"No matter how hard it gets,

30:44.877 --> 30:47.535
"you stick your chest out,
you keep your head up,

30:47.673 --> 30:49.399
and you handle it."

30:49.537 --> 30:51.021
Okay?

30:51.159 --> 30:53.058
Was that supposed to be
a pep talk?

30:55.370 --> 30:56.855
It's Tupac.

30:58.684 --> 31:00.375
How did that work out for him?

31:02.861 --> 31:04.207
That's too far, man.

31:04.345 --> 31:06.519
- I'm just saying, I mean...
-Guys.

31:06.657 --> 31:08.314
I see something.

31:55.120 --> 31:56.535
All right. What do you think?

32:00.573 --> 32:02.299
It's your call.

32:03.783 --> 32:06.407
It's a really
fucking open field.

32:07.926 --> 32:09.582
Chief is in bad shape.

32:09.720 --> 32:12.137
You have to make a decision.

32:12.275 --> 32:15.692
And we will follow you
either way.

32:21.594 --> 32:24.943
Okay. Okay. We hole up
in that barn for the night.

32:25.081 --> 32:26.599
But we gotta go now before
these birds circle back.

32:26.737 --> 32:28.118
- Okay.
- Good?

32:28.256 --> 32:31.087
- Okay.
-Okay?

32:41.235 --> 32:42.581
Stay low.

32:44.755 --> 32:46.033
Go, go.

32:49.450 --> 32:51.003
Go, go, go.

32:51.141 --> 32:52.625
Go.

32:52.763 --> 32:54.455
♪ See I'm looking
in the darkness ♪

32:54.593 --> 32:55.904
♪ So cold, so heartless ♪

32:56.043 --> 32:57.216
♪ I'm about to
run the gauntlet... ♪

32:57.354 --> 32:59.563
This is crazy.

32:59.701 --> 33:01.427
♪ Gotta make it
through the night ♪

33:01.565 --> 33:03.429
♪ Yeah, I'm ready
for the fight ♪

33:03.567 --> 33:04.603
♪ Watch out for the bites ♪

33:04.741 --> 33:06.812
♪ They will end your life ♪

33:08.193 --> 33:09.159
Secure the barn.

33:09.297 --> 33:10.712
♪ Yeah! ♪

33:21.551 --> 33:23.001
Set.

33:23.139 --> 33:24.140
Go!

33:26.383 --> 33:27.867
♪ Yeah! ♪

33:28.006 --> 33:29.248
-Clear?
-Clear.

33:29.386 --> 33:31.009
Thank God. Let's go get him.

33:37.084 --> 33:38.568
Bring in Chief.

33:38.706 --> 33:40.880
Come on.

33:41.019 --> 33:44.643
Easy. Okay. Come down here.

33:44.781 --> 33:46.576
Easy. Okay.

33:46.714 --> 33:48.888
How you doing, Chief?

33:49.027 --> 33:52.444
Okay. You just hang in there
and I'm gonna get you square.

33:52.582 --> 33:54.032
Okay.

33:59.416 --> 34:01.073
- He's seizing! He's seizing!
-Shit!

34:01.211 --> 34:02.454
Help me! Put him on his side.

34:02.592 --> 34:04.145
Put him on his side.
Okay. Hold him.

34:04.283 --> 34:06.078
Put him on his side.
Okay. Okay.

34:06.216 --> 34:07.597
Hold his arm... Okay.

34:11.394 --> 34:12.533
Everybody relax.

34:15.329 --> 34:16.364
I'll fucking drop him!

34:16.502 --> 34:17.883
No, Ross.
Just chill out, okay?

34:18.021 --> 34:19.436
What is he saying?

34:19.574 --> 34:21.335
What the fuck?
How the fuck should I know?

34:21.473 --> 34:23.164
He's Korean
and you're Korean, you know.

34:23.302 --> 34:25.408
My grandparents are Korean, man.
I'm from fucking Gardena.

34:25.546 --> 34:26.616
Fucking shit.

34:32.104 --> 34:33.140
What does that mean?

34:33.278 --> 34:34.589
I asked him for a beer.

34:34.727 --> 34:36.902
Fucking shit.

34:37.040 --> 34:39.387
It's the only thing I know, man.

34:39.525 --> 34:40.802
Wave that thing at me again

34:40.940 --> 34:42.770
and I'm putting him
the fuck down!

34:42.908 --> 34:44.772
Ross, please, chill.

34:44.910 --> 34:46.222
- Selby, what's going on?
- Need one more second.

34:46.360 --> 34:48.603
Just hang in there, Chief.

34:48.741 --> 34:50.985
Lee, tell him to put
his gun down in Korean.

34:51.123 --> 34:53.091
Hey, motherfucker,
put the fucking gun down, man.

34:53.229 --> 34:54.126
Shit.

34:57.233 --> 34:58.544
Fuck. Fuck.

35:00.132 --> 35:01.444
Okay.

35:01.582 --> 35:02.686
I'm gonna fucking shoot him.

35:02.824 --> 35:04.343
I'm gonna fucking shoot him!

35:04.481 --> 35:06.104
One, two...

35:06.242 --> 35:07.967
Ross,
fucking calm the fuck down!

35:14.836 --> 35:15.941
You sure he's not gonna shoot?

35:16.079 --> 35:17.253
He's not gonna shoot!

35:17.391 --> 35:18.909
Stay in your fucking lane, bro!

35:20.946 --> 35:23.742
One, two, three...

35:23.880 --> 35:26.676
Ross, think! He would have
already pulled the trigger!

35:29.644 --> 35:30.852
Okay! Okay!

35:30.990 --> 35:32.337
Okay. Okay.

35:32.475 --> 35:34.994
- What the fuck?
- Look. Right here.

35:35.133 --> 35:36.272
It's okay.

35:36.410 --> 35:37.790
Relax. Okay?

35:37.928 --> 35:39.102
Brockman.

35:39.240 --> 35:41.242
What the fuck are you doing?

35:43.520 --> 35:45.971
We are not here to hurt you.

35:46.109 --> 35:48.456
- All right?
-One, two, three...

35:48.594 --> 35:50.078
Please. We need your help.

35:50.217 --> 35:52.840
If you could just
put your gun down.

35:57.362 --> 35:58.639
Fucking...

36:00.123 --> 36:02.677
Chief.

36:04.334 --> 36:06.164
Two, three...

36:07.165 --> 36:09.305
Just please...

36:09.443 --> 36:12.687
Please, just...
Just put it down.

36:12.825 --> 36:14.310
Just put it down. It's okay.

36:14.448 --> 36:15.897
It's okay.

36:16.035 --> 36:18.348
There you go. There you go.
Yeah. I got it.

36:19.901 --> 36:21.869
- There you go.
-Fuck me.

36:22.973 --> 36:24.492
- It's okay.
-Come on. Come on.

36:24.630 --> 36:26.114
Thank you.

36:29.842 --> 36:32.707
Come on. We gotta
get you home. Come on.

36:32.845 --> 36:35.089
- You just keep breathing.
-Selby.

36:35.227 --> 36:38.092
Come on. I can do this.
I can do this.

36:38.230 --> 36:40.059
Selby.

36:40.198 --> 36:41.440
Selby, that's enough.
Stop. It's enough!

36:41.578 --> 36:43.649
What? What?

36:43.787 --> 36:45.893
He's gone.

36:51.001 --> 36:52.658
- I'm sorry.
- No, no.

37:02.289 --> 37:04.601
You did good. Yeah.

37:07.466 --> 37:09.330
I... I know.

37:48.714 --> 37:49.991
Fuck! He's running!

37:50.129 --> 37:51.579
- Oh, fuck me!
- Shit!

37:51.717 --> 37:53.581
No, no, no! You stay! Stay!

37:55.687 --> 37:57.309
Selby! I got him!

38:00.692 --> 38:02.797
Securing the house.

38:02.935 --> 38:04.834
Lee, take him.

38:15.500 --> 38:16.673
Clear.

38:16.811 --> 38:18.468
- Ross?
-Clear.

38:21.195 --> 38:22.817
-Help! Guys!
-Shit.

38:22.955 --> 38:24.992
Go, go, go!

38:30.204 --> 38:31.723
Back the fuck up!

38:31.861 --> 38:33.518
Back the fuck up!

38:33.656 --> 38:34.657
All right, all right!

38:34.795 --> 38:35.865
Get the fuck over here!

38:36.003 --> 38:37.694
Shut the fuck up!

38:37.832 --> 38:40.076
All right, all right, all
right, all right, all right.

38:40.214 --> 38:41.249
Ross.

38:45.530 --> 38:46.910
Lady, chill the fuck out.

38:47.048 --> 38:48.740
-Shut the fuck up!
-Ross.

38:48.878 --> 38:52.606
Let's gently, gently move them
into the living room, okay?

38:52.744 --> 38:53.883
Hey.

38:54.021 --> 38:54.987
We'll keep them there

38:55.125 --> 38:56.368
until we leave in the morning.

38:59.164 --> 39:00.338
Okay.

39:00.476 --> 39:01.546
Come on. Come on.

39:01.684 --> 39:03.858
- Come on.
- Come on.

39:03.996 --> 39:05.204
What are they doing?

39:05.343 --> 39:06.516
They won't move!

39:06.654 --> 39:09.864
Come on. Come on!

39:10.002 --> 39:11.556
Do you hear that?

39:14.697 --> 39:16.699
What the fuck is that?

39:18.045 --> 39:19.322
What the fuck is that?

39:22.187 --> 39:24.189
Shit.
It's coming from the floor.

39:25.397 --> 39:26.640
Oh, God.

39:28.020 --> 39:29.367
It's coming
from the fucking floor!

39:32.093 --> 39:34.820
Lee, grab the bed. Lee!

39:37.927 --> 39:40.274
What the fuck is that?

39:47.764 --> 39:49.110
Show your face!

39:49.248 --> 39:51.043
Show your head!

39:51.181 --> 39:52.942
- Show your face!
- Shut the fuck up!

39:53.080 --> 39:55.323
Show me your goddamn face!

39:55.462 --> 39:58.396
Show me your fucking face
or I'll blow your brains out!

40:02.710 --> 40:04.712
Show me your fucking face!

40:13.825 --> 40:15.482
It's a kid.

40:15.620 --> 40:18.450
It's a kid.

40:18.588 --> 40:20.314
Okay.

40:20.452 --> 40:21.902
Hey, hey.

40:27.079 --> 40:28.874
I'm so sorry.

40:34.949 --> 40:37.227
There you go.

40:37.365 --> 40:38.436
- Go to your mama.
<i>- Omma!</i>

40:51.552 --> 40:53.002
Shit.

40:56.384 --> 40:57.765
Okay. All right.

40:57.903 --> 40:59.422
Fuck.

41:11.192 --> 41:12.987
It's all right.

41:28.313 --> 41:30.280
You good?

41:32.835 --> 41:34.595
Mmm.

41:37.218 --> 41:39.082
Okay.

41:53.338 --> 41:54.857
Yo.

41:54.995 --> 41:56.962
It's Miller time.

42:01.553 --> 42:03.244
Come on, man. It's funny.

42:04.522 --> 42:07.352
You get it. Asking that
Korean guy for a beer.

42:09.285 --> 42:12.046
Wow. Did you rehearse
that one inside?

42:13.392 --> 42:14.428
Well, I'm...

42:16.016 --> 42:19.088
I'm funny. It's funny.

42:19.226 --> 42:20.572
- I'm funny.
- No, you're not.

42:20.710 --> 42:22.540
- I'm funny.
- No, you're not.

43:09.241 --> 43:10.795
Um...

43:16.732 --> 43:17.974
Om, nom, nom, nom.

43:18.112 --> 43:19.389
Ah!

43:19.527 --> 43:22.254
Wow!

44:26.387 --> 44:28.838
My grandma used to
listen to this song.

44:45.475 --> 44:47.615
Oh, um...

44:50.584 --> 44:52.103
Come... Come sit.

44:53.932 --> 44:56.486
Yeah, look... Face that way.

44:56.624 --> 44:58.040
Yeah.

45:23.617 --> 45:27.414
Okay. Uh... There you go.

45:44.017 --> 45:46.674
Who knew that, um, protein
bars and a little music

45:46.813 --> 45:49.194
would be the great unifier.

45:49.332 --> 45:52.439
I think we all just want
the same thing.

45:52.577 --> 45:54.510
Oh, really? What's that?

45:55.545 --> 45:56.650
For you to shut up.

45:58.238 --> 45:59.653
That's good.

45:59.791 --> 46:01.517
That's really good.
I was gonna say "Love,"

46:01.655 --> 46:03.415
- but I appreciate the dig.
-Uh-huh.

46:05.003 --> 46:08.179
No, no, go ahead.

46:08.317 --> 46:10.146
I deserve it.

46:12.770 --> 46:13.978
I deserve it.

46:16.187 --> 46:18.499
How did you know
he wasn't gonna shoot?

46:18.637 --> 46:22.365
I just saw a man
who had something to live for.

46:22.503 --> 46:24.022
Kind of like we all do.

46:25.921 --> 46:26.991
Yeah.

46:29.269 --> 46:31.133
Hey, let me ask
you two something.

46:32.997 --> 46:35.137
You both seem pretty smart.

46:35.275 --> 46:36.345
Why choose this?

46:38.657 --> 46:41.177
Following Daddy?

46:41.315 --> 46:43.179
Dad was an alcoholic.

46:45.906 --> 46:48.529
Did us all a favor
and died when I was little.

46:48.667 --> 46:51.015
- Oh, hey, I'm sorry. I...
-No, no.

46:51.153 --> 46:52.810
It's fine.

46:57.884 --> 47:00.714
Where I come from, there just
isn't a lot of options.

47:03.441 --> 47:05.477
You either...

47:05.615 --> 47:09.274
get stuck at some
shitty restaurant or...

47:11.552 --> 47:13.865
...you throw on a uniform.

47:15.971 --> 47:17.213
So...

47:19.146 --> 47:20.734
I chose this.

47:24.565 --> 47:26.222
Damn.

47:26.360 --> 47:27.914
That's pathetically cliché.

47:30.709 --> 47:32.573
Yeah, that kind of
seems to be my brand, huh?

47:35.024 --> 47:36.888
What about you, Selby?
What's your sob story?

47:37.958 --> 47:39.753
I was born in Vietnam.

47:39.891 --> 47:42.549
- I was adopted as a baby...
- No shit.

47:42.687 --> 47:45.069
...and I was brought
to the States.

47:45.207 --> 47:46.691
Our country
has given me so much,

47:46.829 --> 47:49.763
and I wanted to give back.

47:51.454 --> 47:53.940
- Hmm.
- That was deep.

47:55.251 --> 47:58.082
And my story
was pathetically cliché?

47:58.220 --> 48:01.292
- I'm just asking for a friend.
- Okay, okay.

48:01.430 --> 48:03.190
Ooh-wah.

48:03.328 --> 48:05.468
- Don't. No.
- No. Don't say that.

48:05.606 --> 48:06.953
- What is wrong with you?
- I...

48:07.091 --> 48:08.816
- It's cool, but...
- Doesn't feel cool.

48:08.955 --> 48:10.404
Just you never say that again.

48:10.542 --> 48:11.716
Okay.

48:14.857 --> 48:16.410
All right.
We're out before sunrise.

48:16.548 --> 48:19.620
So, uh, I'm gonna go
